{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "996f23d61fa9be565369b76131fc5bd0acafd3c2702f938b43d140f315976dc2", "ja": "（昨日は、琴葉が劇場の定期公演に出演した。\n幕が閉まる最後まで、琴葉は笑顔だったな……）", "zh": "（昨天琴叶参加了剧场的定期公演。\n直到最后谢幕，琴叶一直都在笑着呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ca42084d7590284fe43eaef0cdb61815f489ff7b065cae9eeb2d77b158f36d47", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。\n久しぶりの定期公演はどうだった？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n好久没参加定期公演，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "feb74f6a456f442430480d262c8dbe9c801c131a8042bdc0a3e3615e67e80093", "ja": "はい、楽しかったです。とても！\nファンの人達にも、感謝の気持ちを伝えられました。", "zh": "是的，非常开心！\n也向粉丝们传达了我的感谢之情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "d88677d88359d739ac51e2420278fe69393fccaaf27f9384c473b3a0cd45eec7", "ja": "でも不思議です……。ステージには何度も立ってるのに\n新鮮な気持ちと感謝が絶えなくて……。", "zh": "不过，真不可思议……明明已经登上舞台很多次了，\n却总能感受到新鲜感和感激之情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f353e9586aa5b82080fccce887327785308b7646ed095d7572114850bf6ae650", "ja": "ははっ、いいことじゃないか。\nきっと琴葉が、初心を忘れてないからだと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这不是好事吗？\n我想，一定是因为琴叶没有忘记初心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "5015f9ea64375f18017188d70eb828355d2746b04c59ff5eb389a59e53010cf1", "ja": "そう……だといいんですけど。\n成長してないだけかも、なんて考える時もあって。", "zh": "要是……真的是这样就好了。\n有时候我也会想，会不会只是自己没有成长而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1a3e2651693d3a9dcbe80cdffa35efd164250c3f04fd1a6f47343e0c13e58762", "ja": "大丈夫！　着実に成長してるよ、琴葉は。\nまあ、俺の言葉より見せた方が早いかな……ほら！", "zh": "没事的！你确实在一稳步成长啊，琴叶。\n不过，比起我用嘴说，还是直接给你看更快吧……你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1007_se", "source_sha256": "bd34885ea88304341e34c7569792965841d74a52031f41180dc607a6b6f842d2", "ja": "ドサッ！", "zh": "（倒下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "7b29721bbb91691d219714a116ecdb92484d7f17d428f6da193b80725fa191f0", "ja": "わぁっ。手紙とプレゼントがいっぱい……！\nもしかして、昨日のライブの？", "zh": "哇。有好多信和礼物……！\n难道是昨天的演出的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bc50d1f4ce5a74d4b35504cabc93d69dcd90003af80b2e9948e516b4cc32111e", "ja": "ああ。でもこれは琴葉の分だ。昨日渡したかったん\nだけど、チェックに時間が掛かってね。", "zh": "啊，不过这些是琴叶的那份。本来想昨天交给她的，但检查花了点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "b8fdb8161e7bfd2619f88473d108ac396adf8447f83bbcf9ef2be24da6e9e53d", "ja": "えっ！　私の……！？", "zh": "诶！我的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1011_p", "source_sha256": "da41eee79d61d6e104b3a91c88340ee6b77275e873de83e4b6689f969c462a37", "ja": "そうだよ。プレゼントや手紙は、このくらいだけど。\n実際は、もっと多くの人が応援してると思う。", "zh": "就是这样。礼物和信件虽然只有这么多，\n但我觉得实际上还有更多人在支持你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d22b300e508dcfdbb7c17599f4bc13b5fd181e579f693734b57b9ca25f849b1e", "ja": "琴葉の思いを受け取って、好きになってくれた人達だ。\nだから琴葉は、もっと自信を持っていいんだよ。", "zh": "是因为接受了琴叶的心意，才喜欢上她的人。\n所以，琴叶可以更有自信一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "0962269fecc203e6ac8aede52f89e5c4d38fd4d76f99e9c875e1531f06f12dcb", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}……。\nさっきの言葉は、みなさんの気持ちに失礼でした。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}……\n我刚才的那番话，太对不起大家的心意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "e9fde53fb047fe1a89201107e16fe77f0a115a3c462db058ebbefc4c90f4cff4", "ja": "すぐに自信を持つのは難しいですけど、\n私らしく、少しずつ積み重ねていこうと思います。", "zh": "虽然很难马上建立自信，\n但我会按照自己的方式，一点一点地积累下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a3be62609c211f1586200f184cdee3e8a21bb1d99cab81b438f35a3771c30841", "ja": "そうだな。一緒に頑張ろう、琴葉！", "zh": "是啊。一起加油吧，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "14ae57f67f26a782f9ca3752299f6af9802697b36e572f545900a96b7c14f3a1", "ja": "はい！　それじゃ、まずはプレゼントと手紙を確認して\nみなさんに返事を書かないと！", "zh": "好的！那就先确认礼物和信件，\n然后得给大家写回信才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7f9e801754767415b6c4c543fe4904e9d6aeb72ce62a1fa917505c145f00eac5", "ja": "……この量の、返事を？", "zh": "……要把这些全都回复吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "f9a65826a10507d20ee62286d905f2afe97b7b605d237e84a98e49986af6b6d7", "ja": "？　そうですよ？　みなさんの気持ちを\n無視するわけにはいきませんから。", "zh": "？是这样没错吧？毕竟不能无视大家的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0463_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "53152e5669e8c37da14383ad011024a6cf947bc6f97beb00db1f9b317c081cc5", "ja": "それに『初心忘るべからず』ですよね♪\nえっと、書くものとレターセットを用意して……。", "zh": "而且要“不忘初心”才行呢♪\n呃，先准备好要写的东西和信纸信封……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
